CORE
JmlResult
--function JmlResult.clampLow --jml-source src/main/java/JmlResult.java --unwind 5 -cp target/classes
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR
^.*FAILURE$
--
Regression for JML \result references combined with multiple
parameters and multiple ensures clauses.

Verifies that the JML pipeline correctly:
- Maps \result to <method>#return_value
- Resolves the parameters lo, hi (positionally) by base name
- Lowers multiple //@ ensures clauses (one per line) into
  separate ASSERT statements
- Combines requires and ensures correctly: under
  precondition lo <= hi, the clamp result is in [lo, hi]
